1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
I shall always recognize you
by the dreadful sword you hold,

2
00:00:07,270 --> 00:00:14,280
as the Earth with searching vision
you survey with spirit bold.

3
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:21,360
From the Greeks of old whose dying
brought to life and spirit free,

4
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:28,530
now, with ancient valor rising,
let us hail you, O Liberty!

5
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:36,230
Now, with ancient valor rising,
let us hail you, O Liberty!

6
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:39,900
Now, with ancient valor rising...

7
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:43,220
Let us hail you, O Liberty!